msgstr "策略：熔毁"

#. STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1"
msgid "The next hit heals up to %d nearby allies, prioritizing the lowest HP ratio. The first target recovers %g%% of base ATK as HP; each bounce reduces healing by %g%%."
msgstr "下次命中弹射治疗附近最多%d位友军，优先治疗生命比例最低的目标。首位恢复基础攻击力%g%%的生命，之后每跳降低%g%%。"

#. STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2"
msgid "While active, each hit heals up to %d nearby allies. The first target recovers %g%% of base ATK as HP; each bounce reduces healing by %g%%. Healing grants %g times the usual attack speed bonus for 10 seconds. Stacks with Hyperpressurized Link."
msgstr "技能期间，每次命中弹射治疗附近最多%d位友军。首位恢复基础攻击力%g%%的生命，之后每跳降低%g%%。治疗提供的攻速加成提升至%g倍，持续10秒。可与超压链接叠加。"

#. STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.3"
msgid "Leap to the selected position and unequip the hand slot. Consume up to 10%% of Reconstruction's durability to gain base ATK.\nAttack damage becomes %g times its original value, attack speed and range increase, and melee attacks deal True damage to nearby enemies.\nMax HP +%d; lose %d HP per second. Hits restore 100%% of base ATK as HP to herself.\nReturn to the starting position when the skill ends or lethal damage is taken."
msgstr "跃向选定位置并解除手持装备，吸收重构体最高10%%的耐久，获得基础攻击力加成。\n攻击伤害变为%g倍，攻速与攻击范围提高，近战攻击对附近敌人造成真实伤害。\n生命上限+%d，每秒流失%d点生命；命中时恢复自身基础攻击力100%%的生命。\n技能结束或受到致命伤害时，返回初始位置。"

#. STRINGS.UI.MON3TR_TACTICAL_SYNERGY_BUFF.TITLE
